		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="bc10_01_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>じゅうぶんな　しげきは
ひとの　せいちょうを　はやくする▽
そんな　ことばが　にあう　まちだよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>十分な　刺激は
人の　成長を　早くする▽
そんな　言葉が　似合う　街だよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOY3
シュウサク</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="bc10_02_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヒロコ『わたしの　メガネが
ピーンときた　そこの　あなた▽
ポケモンしょうぶ　しましょうよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヒロコ『わたしの　メガネが
ピーンときた　そこの　あなた▽
ポケモン勝負　しましょうよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GIRL3
ヒロコ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="bc10_02_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>メ……　メガネに　ひびが　はいったわ
なんて　ステキな　しょうぶ　なの！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>メ……　メガネに　ひびが　はいったわ
なんて　ステキな　勝負なの！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GIRL3
ヒロコ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="bc10_02_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ここで　すごした　じかんは
すごく　たのしくて　ステキ　だったわ▼
でも　しげき　だらけな　まいにちだと
なんだか　しぜんが　こいしいの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ここで　すごした　時間は
すごく　楽しくて　ステキ　だったわ▼
でも　刺激　だらけな　毎日だと
なんだか　自然が　恋しいの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GIRL3
ヒロコ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="bc10_02_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>メガネに　うつる　たくさんの　ビル！
めまいが　しちゃうぐらい　ステキね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>メガネに　映る　たくさんの　ビル！
めまいが　しちゃうぐらい　ステキね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
